// "Échappée Pissenlit": the first long race (issue #119, GD § 1 « Les courses longues »), an
// open circuit: one long way of about 6 km through the meadows, from its start line to a finish
// elsewhere, in three sections (no lap). Original layout. A journey: the meadow and its
// hairpins, the wall (anti-gravity) on an embankment (section 1); up onto the cliffs, the risky
// jump across a tight corner, the glide down over the lake, the ford, the switchbacks (section 2);
// back along the south, the hidden road behind a needle of rock and the grass bridge, down the
// hill to the finish (section 3). It follows the guide « Conception des circuits »: many hairpins
// and tight corners in each section (a section is as dense as a lap), walls but where a drop is
// worth the risk, the hidden shortcuts of issue #156 (their pieces, the risky jump's too, are the
// Corniche Cannelle's, whose gains and hiding were tuned: GD « Ce qu'il a appris »).
//
// Drawn as a plan of straights and arcs, its points every 8 m along it.
//
// Format: see src/track/data.rs (`open`: the finish, the road's ends, the sections). Point 0 is
// the start line; karts drive toward point 1 (north, -Z).
(
    name: "Échappée Pissenlit",
    // Dressing (issue #11): the meadow (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), the same every time (seed).
    biome: "Prairie",
    // Issue #104: its music (`assets/data/music.ron`).
    music: "cool-highway",
    decor_seed: 119,
    checkpoint_spacing: 25.0,
    // Issue #146: more far decor than the meadow's: a long race crosses a wide country, the
    // corners of its ground far from the road; a ring of low wooded hills right beyond its ground,
    // in front of the meadow's hills and mountains, and giant oaks and pines deep in the meadows
    // between its loops.
    far_decor: [
        Range(distance: 60.0, depth: 60.0, height: (34.0, 54.0), spacing: 40.0,
              color: (0.36, 0.60, 0.33)),
        Pieces(models: ["nature-kit/tree_oak", "nature-kit/tree_fat", "nature-kit/tree_pineRoundA"],
               count: 40, height: (22.0, 34.0), radius: 9.0, distance: (100.0, 380.0)),
    ],
    open: (finish: 689.000, road_end: 709.000, road_start: 723.000, sections: [213.000, 461.000]),
    points: [
